      "excerpt": "A complete beginner guide to downloading, securing, and using a Web3 wallet for airdrop farming.",
      "content": "Your Web3 wallet is your gateway to the decentralized internet. The most popular wallet for EVM-compatible chains is MetaMask. To get started, download the official browser extension from metamask.io.\n\nDuring setup, you will be given a 12 or 24-word Secret Recovery Phrase. This is the master key to your funds. Write it down on a physical piece of paper and store it in a fireproof safe. Never take a screenshot of it or save it in a cloud text document.\n\nOnce installed, you can add different networks like Arbitrum, Optimism, or BNB Chain, and start funding your wallet from a centralized exchange to pay for gas fees."
