      "excerpt": "Learn the basics of crypto airdrops, why projects give away free tokens, and how you can position yourself to earn them safely.",
      "content": "A crypto airdrop is a marketing strategy used by blockchain startups to distribute free tokens to their community. Projects do this to decentralize their token distribution, reward early testers, and create a strong, loyal user base before they officially launch on exchanges.\n\nTo participate, users typically need to interact with a protocol during its early stages. This could involve bridging funds, swapping tokens, minting NFTs, or simply providing liquidity. By doing so, you leave an \"on-chain footprint\" that the project later takes a snapshot of to determine your eligibility.\n\nAlways remember to use a dedicated wallet for airdrop farming to minimize risk, and never share your seed phrase."
